<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>热症门 on 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E7%83%AD%E7%97%87%E9%97%A8/</link><description>Recent content in 热症门 on 观颐斋</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Fri, 03 Jul 2026 09:45:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E7%83%AD%E7%97%87%E9%97%A8/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>热症门</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/6-5-rezhenmen/</link><pubDate>Fri, 03 Jul 2026 09:40:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/6-5-rezhenmen/</guid><description>本节为《石室秘录》“热症门”部分，由&lt;strong&gt;雷公真君&lt;/strong&gt;专论&lt;strong&gt;热病发狂如见鬼、热病不知人、火盛舌裂大渴、产后大汗发热&lt;/strong&gt;等热症危候的辨治法则。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;热症当分虚实，实热宜泻火佐以益气，虚热宜清火兼以滋肝开郁；大热证用甘寒清润以护胃，产后虚热则大补气血以敛汗固脱。治热不远凉，然必顾护正气&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item></channel></rss>